            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="SUMMARY" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">We describe a software package that provides a graphical summary of linkage disequilibrium in human genetic data. It allows for the analysis of family data and is well suited to the analysis of dense genetic maps.</AbstractText>
